        "Target-Site Resistance (TSR): point mutations (ALS Pro197/Trp574) and gene amplification (EPSPS)",
        "Non-Target Site Resistance (NTSR): cytochrome P450 metabolism, GSTs, and vacuolar sequestration",
        "Danger of metabolic cross-resistance to unexposed chemical families",
        "Five-point IWM mitigation blueprint: mode-of-action rotation, tank mixes, crop rotation, and HWSC"
